   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "\u2460 Carmy's brief for this round\n\n- what the op must compute\n- best kernel so far + its speed\n  at each shape, OR the closest\n  failure + exactly where it broke\n- everything already tried, and\n  what the judge said about it\n- lessons the judge has proven",
   "originalText": "\u2460 Carmy's brief for this round\n\n- what the op must compute\n- best kernel so far + its speed\n  at each shape, OR the closest\n  failure + exactly where it broke\n- everything already tried, and\n  what the judge said about it\n- lessons the judge has proven",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
