   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Gate 3  Correctness, for every launch config\nrun hundreds of inputs; compare every row with a\nfloat64 answer key, within a tolerance fixed in advance\n\nalso, with zero tolerance:\n+ output pre-filled with NaN: a missed write shows up\n+ guard zone after the output: no writing past the end\n+ 5 identical runs must match byte for byte (races)\n+ the op's own rules, e.g. softmax rows sum to 1",
   "originalText": "Gate 3  Correctness, for every launch config\nrun hundreds of inputs; compare every row with a\nfloat64 answer key, within a tolerance fixed in advance\n\nalso, with zero tolerance:\n+ output pre-filled with NaN: a missed write shows up\n+ guard zone after the output: no writing past the end\n+ 5 identical runs must match byte for byte (races)\n+ the op's own rules, e.g. softmax rows sum to 1",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "g3",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
