   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Where Gate 3's inputs come from\n\n- fixed tricky set: lengths 1, 7, 33,\n  257 ... 70001, values up to \u00b110\u2074,\n  -inf masks, fp32 / fp16 / bf16\n- fresh fuzz: random new shapes,\n  new seed every round\n- regression corpus: every input that\n  ever broke a draft, kept forever\n\nIf stock MLX also fails an input,\nthe input is dropped as unfair.",
   "originalText": "Where Gate 3's inputs come from\n\n- fixed tricky set: lengths 1, 7, 33,\n  257 ... 70001, values up to \u00b110\u2074,\n  -inf masks, fp32 / fp16 / bf16\n- fresh fuzz: random new shapes,\n  new seed every round\n- regression corpus: every input that\n  ever broke a draft, kept forever\n\nIf stock MLX also fails an input,\nthe input is dropped as unfair.",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 1,
